X: 1
T: A Pilgrim and a Stranger
C: Words: Paul Gerhardt, 1666. Translated by Jane Borthwick, 1858. 
C: Music: 'Passion Chorale' or 'Herzlich Tut Mich Verlangen' Hans Leo Hassler, 1601. Adapted by J.S. Bach, 1729.  
C: Setting: Johann Sebastian Bach, 1729. 
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: The Episcopal Hymnal, 1916, Hymn 158.
S: Lyrics Source: "Hymns From the Land of Luther", 1866 Hymn 60.
M: 4/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
